A '''Salmon''' is a [[Critter]] that can be found on the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Spawning ==
'''Salmon''' spawn in water in the {{zone|Murkwater Loch}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Salmon''' swim alone or in schools. When the player throws a [[Fishing Net]], it slows down and gains a {{Blue|⁂}} symbol above its head. After reaching {{Green|4}} {{Blue|⁂}} symbols, the '''Salmon''' becomes exhausted and drops a {{Item|Salmon Shard}}.

